  "description": "Fuaran server-driven interactivity — the transport-agnostic core for the third client tier (HTMX / LiveView / Blazor-Server-shaped): the closure-free DomPatch + ClientEffect wire vocabularies the generic JS shim applies, the TreeOp→DomPatch lowering, the per-connection driver, and the IFuaranLiveChannel transport seam. Keep the Elmish update loop on the server; ship ~nothing to the browser. No platform-SDK dependency. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
